<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>2022-09 on</title><link>https://yshghid.github.io/tags/2022-09/</link><description>Recent content in 2022-09 on</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 19 Sep 2022 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://yshghid.github.io/tags/2022-09/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>야외에서일기</title><link>https://yshghid.github.io/docs/previous/2022/22blog21/</link><pubDate>Mon, 19 Sep 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://yshghid.github.io/docs/previous/2022/22blog21/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="야외에서일기"&gt;&#10; 야외에서일기&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#%ec%95%bc%ec%99%b8%ec%97%90%ec%84%9c%ec%9d%bc%ea%b8%b0"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;#2022. 9. 19. 15:32&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1430" height="1578" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/224ccba6-ce2e-4487-8984-c3350e339fe5" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;속이답답한것인지 걍날씨가좋아서인지 자꾸 집에못있겠어서 놀이터가서 노래틀어놓고 하염없이 앉아있음&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="828" height="1792" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/18a0e5e6-e24f-4fdd-8d2e-bef57c7412e0" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;ㅋㅋㅋ 사회에 던져졌는데 생각보다 내가 처신너무못해서 이런거 찾아보고있음&amp;hellip;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="828" height="1792" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/07604dd0-487f-4687-b3be-0e4f26a3dc04" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;새로산 모자 ~~&#10;맘에 든당&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9140945b-57b7-4a54-8da6-b5bf5eaa1213" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;예뻐보여서 찍었음&#10;늦여름감성 🌊🌊&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a20a524c-8d76-451a-81f0-0a274bc1644f" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;이렇게 입을까 했는데 뒷모습이너무 안예쁜것같기도해서 폐기함&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b27c6f55-c0b2-4d9b-beb1-e0061f7ae90e" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;오늘 뭔가 입을게 없어서 검정 입었는데 나쁘지않았네&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2d991d0f-6aa2-4272-b58d-0137e9d9f929" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;애매한 시간에 나오니 한적하고 좋았다 !!&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>그런날</title><link>https://yshghid.github.io/docs/previous/2022/22blog20/</link><pubDate>Sat, 10 Sep 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://yshghid.github.io/docs/previous/2022/22blog20/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="그런날"&gt;&#10; 그런날&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#%ea%b7%b8%eb%9f%b0%eb%82%a0"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;#2022. 9. 10. 20:37&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;나는오늘하루 솔직하게 행동했고 그거면됐음&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://youtu.be/PgGy2dQO868"&gt;https://youtu.be/PgGy2dQO868&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;원래 그렇게 생각하지도않았던 부분들이 막 나올때가 있음. 그래서 오디오가비면 말을 그냥 안한다라고 38분에나온다 이사람 말은 왤케 위로가 되지 오늘여러모로 혼란속에좀있었는데 맘가라앉히고 투자해서 공부하려고간카페는 와이파이가 너무너무느려 30분동안헤매다 그냥나왔다. 이럴거면 운동이라도했으면 돈도아끼고 운동도됐겠지. 근데그냥왔다 그리고 마음을 다잡았다 이런일이생긴건 큰 재난이 일어나서가아니라 그냥 일어난거야 떨치고 다음삶을살면되는거야&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>시발 ㅠㅠ</title><link>https://yshghid.github.io/docs/previous/2022/22blog04/</link><pubDate>Mon, 05 Sep 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://yshghid.github.io/docs/previous/2022/22blog04/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="시발-ㅠㅠ"&gt;&#10; 시발 ㅠㅠ&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#%ec%8b%9c%eb%b0%9c-%e3%85%a0%e3%85%a0"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;#2022. 9. 5. 18:59&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="2275" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/832149bc-e843-4c23-b1db-03078fcecab2" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;it관에서 길잃고존나걷다가 겨우 원래자리도찯해서 거기서부터 걷다가 바지질질끌리는거 도저히용서안돼서 돌돌말아올리고 (추하게) 뇌빼고 걷다보미 정류장옴 지금얼굴에물기미쳤음 집가서에어컨틀고이ㅛ어야지무조건 죽을거같다 시발 ㅜ 연구실가서는 왕따처럼이ㅛ러ㅛ음 언제나처럼. 그리고인턴여자애나시러하는듯 ㅇㅇ&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>난슬플때 일상을써</title><link>https://yshghid.github.io/docs/previous/2022/22blog19/</link><pubDate>Fri, 02 Sep 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://yshghid.github.io/docs/previous/2022/22blog19/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="난슬플때-일상을써"&gt;&#10; 난슬플때 일상을써&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#%eb%82%9c%ec%8a%ac%ed%94%8c%eb%95%8c-%ec%9d%bc%ec%83%81%ec%9d%84%ec%8d%a8"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;#2022. 9. 2. 23:27&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="960" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ae6aeae3-5ab2-4509-b8c5-af0d749ccdc7" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;진짜너무맛있다 근데저 남산왕돈까스소스 다먹어서 이제없다&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c68521ce-c4a4-4e8b-a58a-6fa22fddd3e3" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;살지말지 되게고민했는데 엄청잘입고다님&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;ol&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;집앞 카페(검정 바지)&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;오빠랑 산책(회색 바지)&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;첫 랩미팅 참관(청바지 넣입)&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;코스트코(청바지 빼입)&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;엄마 골프장(레깅스)&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ol&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;많이도 입었군&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0350035e-7c2d-4bb6-b960-0b6cf2015a7a" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;난지수가 내편지보고울었는지몰랐음 물론다른것을 보고 울었을수도있지만 난위로가됐다 그것만으로도&amp;hellip; 그리고이날 길혜민이랑 둘이밥먿는데 엄청 바쁜척했고 길혜민같은 내기준 잘꾸미고 잘사는애가 나를 동등하게 봐주는게 찐따같은나로서는 신기하고좋았고 연구실안간건 잘한일같네&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/671cc3a2-cce2-46c2-b40b-2aba2aad610e" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;한창논문읽고있을때..&#10;어휴&#10;부담감왜그렇게심했지&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="796" height="1120" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1e594ab0-815f-46dd-914d-502569eb63bc" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;시간표 나는나름 괜찮음 아쉬운거하나도없고&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="960" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/72f60465-bc90-4c29-b54e-355425cd2920" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;또돈까스&#10;ㅜㅜ최고&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>